com/volunteer</a><span style="color:#008294;">.</span><span style="color:#508142;"> There are a variety of ways to help, please consider contacting the campaigns of these two environmental champions and help elect them to protect and sustain your county from the environmental threats it faces.</span></p><table class="table" border="2" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#99cd99;" colspan="2"><span style="color:#003333;">National</span></td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Congressional District 01</td><td style="width:199px;">Mike McGuire</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Congressional District 02</td><td style="width:199px;">Jared Huffman</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Congressional District 04</td><td style="width:199px;">Mike Thompson</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Congressional District 08</td><td style="width:199px;">John Garamendi</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#99cd99;" colspan="2"><span style="color:#003333;">Statewide Offices</span></td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Secretary of State</td><td style="width:199px;">Shirley Weber</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">State Controller</td><td style="width:199px;">Malia Cohen</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Treasurer</td><td style="width:199px;">Eleni Kounalakis</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Attorney General</td><td style="width:199px;">Rob Bonta</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Insurance Commisssioner</td><td style="width:199px;">Ben Allen</td></tr><tr style="outline:thin solid;"><td style="width:199px;">Superintendent of Public Instruction</td><td style="width:199px;">Richard Barrera</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#99cd99;" colspan="2"><span style="color:#003333;">Sta